#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:2
#: 9129b5c8f6344387a7fc35949c9a2cbd
msgid "ADR-0004: JobStatus 枚举与 DispatchResult 信号载体"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:4
#: c084d667db164a04a30fd30d37be70bd
msgid ""
"**历史参考**：本篇记录旧 GUI（`tod/gui/`）时代的决策，已被 [ADR-0007](0007-big-bang-gui-"
"replacement.md)（大爆炸替换）与 [ADR-0014](0014-migrate-ui-to-tauri.md)（UI 迁移到 "
"Tauri）取代，仅作历史参考，不再指导现行实现。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:6
#: 9fec22744b9440efbad55a8d7ce32a58
msgid "状态"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:8
#: d4c0baf0baf549ae8f5bdeeeafeb8ff3
msgid "已接受"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:10
#: 7bb6dd2dbad24e02a04fcd99d881bff0
msgid "上下文"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:12
#: cbac9508d43a488096caba6dc7d06f9c
msgid ""
"`CONTEXT.md` 定义了 **任务状态** 的五个规范取值：等待中、运行中、成功、失败和已停止。PR1（ADR-0003）引入 "
"`RunConfirmationDialog` 后，GUI 任务生命周期的下一阶段需要统一："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:14
#: dd28b0c8ea87463e88b3d0b26a9bc4e0
msgid ""
"`Job.status` 原为 `str`（`\"running\"` / `\"finished\"` / `\"error\"` / "
"`\"stopped\"`），与 `CONTEXT.md` 的五状态不对应。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:15
#: dccc8813cfb24fb9b3b6eac2de3d073a
msgid ""
"`job_finished` 信号原签名为 `(job_id: str, name: str, exit_code: "
"int)`，消费端（`JobPanelMixin._on_job_finished`）需回调 "
"`JobManager.get_job(job_id)` 查询实际状态再做 UI 更新。这引入 TOCTOU：`stop_job` 已将 "
"`job.status` 标为 `STOPPED`，但 `_on_job_finished` 可能在回调时读到被覆盖的值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:16
#: 832540661c5f47ab817c11e16a0c258c
msgid ""
"`job_error` 信号原签名为 `(job_id: str, error_message: str)`，与 `job_finished` "
"携带不同信息结构，消费端需要分别处理两个信号才能获得完整的状态/错误/脚本名上下文。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:18
#: 7f6fab8683bf4cbdb2a7b8745094386b
msgid "决策"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:20
#: 4670e41661f44d59a248c8ce875ba8aa
msgid "1. 引入 `JobStatus(StrEnum)` 五值枚举"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:31
#: ed4128794b85464d8939067b28b1e381
msgid "继承 `StrEnum`，可直接用于 `str` 比较和 JSON 序列化。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:32
#: 3b6333100868405bab2f275411354b6f
msgid ""
"提供 `is_active` / `is_terminal` 两个 property，通过 `frozenset` 集合判定，不做 "
"`__contains__` 线性扫描。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:33
#: 204671fffe6d478bb125566bffe1cbbc
msgid ""
"提供 `from_exit_code(code, *, stopped=False)` 纯函数：`stopped=True` "
"优先级最高，`code==0` 返回 `SUCCESS`，其他返回 `FAILURE`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:35
#: b060c90e9568430585223c9795668315
msgid "2. 引入 `DispatchResult(frozen=True dataclass)` 统一信号载体"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:47
#: d10f6a59ddeb46248c63f99dfc5e8906
msgid "`job_finished` 和 `job_error` 信号签名统一为 `(DispatchResult)`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:48
#: 0dbe7e79ea094705887968fc2334cb26
msgid ""
"`JobManager._on_finished` / `_on_error` / `start_job` 上限错误均构造 "
"`DispatchResult`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:49
#: 740b0bed21944e9381d92468b50077a5
msgid "消费端（`JobPanelMixin`）直接读 `result.status`，不再回调 `JobManager.get_job`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:50
#: dffb2931735945359b236b6141df0d77
msgid "`frozen=True` 确保信号参数不会被下游意外修改。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:52
#: 5a586f05e01041ef9c6bc3d68330cdfb
msgid "3. `stop_job` 路径的状态归属"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:54
#: 2887932f122b455399c55e88e4ea6d7a
msgid ""
"`stop_job` 显式将 `job.status = JobStatus.STOPPED`，`_on_finished` 看到 "
"`is_terminal` 时跳过 `from_exit_code` 覆盖。`DispatchResult.status` 由 "
"`JobManager` 在构造时一次性确定，消费端无需推断。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:56
#: 2291c37f06db4a5e8e1ebaea2dde4ed8
msgid "4. 中文显示映射集中硬编码"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:68
#: e8dbd8775d324336af570d1c81c2c1ef
msgid "不接 i18n（`CONTEXT.md` 任务状态术语已定），避免翻译缺失导致状态显示空白。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:70
#: d0714966e212442c85160d6e7facfd7c
msgid "后果"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:72
#: 62c96db3d8074ddea889510e8abde76e
msgid "正面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:74
#: 48820728faf347bdbf84c546919a7a9c
msgid "任务状态与 `CONTEXT.md` 五值完全对应，类型安全（`StrEnum`），替代松散的 `str` 比较"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:75
#: e27265526bea4842a240c6cd97063371
msgid "`DispatchResult` 消除 TOCTOU：`_on_job_finished` 无需回调查询，信号携带完整终态"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:76
#: 16e0008c17484b0497361ec72aaa69b5
msgid ""
"`job_finished` / `job_error` 信号签名统一为 `(object)`，`main_window.py` 无需改动（Qt "
"`object` 信号兼容任意 slot 签名）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:77
#: db80b6bc270348fcbfad9915b6a903b8
msgid "`frozen dataclass` + `StrEnum` 对序列化、调试和类型推断友好"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:78
#: 89ee1f1b2a3d497eb5330c1220065b3a
msgid "停止任务的状态由生产端（`JobManager`）确定，而非消费端推断"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:80
#: 4d3e7e922e5944f38b3b5f19d97af1d9
msgid "负面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:82
#: 90b68016744244cfa5a06371c8597bfc
msgid ""
"信号签名变更（`(str, str, int)` → `(object)`）：所有 `connect` "
"代码需要同步更新；`main_window.py` 因 Qt `object` 类型兼容性无需改动，但第三方插件（如有）需注意"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:83
#: e181f22676a64dcd9cafbb010b0b0893
msgid ""
"`Job.status` 从 `str` 迁移到 `JobStatus` 枚举：任何对 `job.status == \"running\"` "
"的字符串比较都会变为类型错误，需要全量 grep 修复"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:85
#: 1dfbbe6902af414b8328884a7d042f50
msgid "后续"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:87
#: 73473ff608fe4f3b8b7d729acaf1c17b
msgid "`PENDING` 状态已就位但尚未引入真实队列调度；留给后续 issue"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0004-job-status-dispatch-result.md:88
#: 49d105384f264bc0b8835da415a20564
msgid "`DispatchResult` 可承载更多诊断字段（如 `wall_time`、`peak_memory`），按需扩展"
msgstr ""

